@base <https://w3id.org/eudpp/SOC#> .

<https://w3id.org/eudpp/SOC> rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
                              <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Hele-Mai Haav"@en ;
                              <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2025-02-27"@en ;
                              <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Tarmo Robal"@en ;
                              <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> """MODULE: SOC
Substances of Concern module of the  EU DPP core ontology proposal of the CIRPASS-2 European project.

DEPENDENCIES:  This module has dependencies to the following EU DPP Core Ontology (CO) modules: CON, P_DPP.  

The third iteration of the Substances of Concern module of the EU DPP core ontology proposal of the CIRPASS-2 European project.

The information requirements laid out in ESPR Art 7(2) and Art 7(5) for products require the information requirements to make it possible to track the substances of concern, throughout the life cycle of the products concerned. These information requirements for specific product groups are specified in the delegated acts adopted pursuant to Art 4 of ESPR.
	
This module addresses only the information requirements referred and stated in the ESPR. 
=====================================
CONTEXT: 
Regulation (EC) No 1907/2006  Art 3(1) defines Substance: means a chemical element and its compounds in the natural state or obtained by
any manufacturing process, including any additive necessary to preserve its stability and any impurity deriving from the process used, but excluding any solvent which may be separated without affecting the stability of the substance or changing its composition; 

------------------------------------------------------------------- 
Known issues:
 - hasLifeCycleStage misses range (Event).

--
THIS DOCUMENT IS PROVIDED WITH NO WARRANTIES WHATSOEVER. 
All liability for any damages arising from use or misuse of this vocabulary is with the user."""@en ;
                              <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-04-30"@en ;
                              <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0> ,
                                                                 """This ontology is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. 
In case of dispute over Apache 2.0 applicability, or in case considering the ontology as a document, this ontology document is to be considered licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)."""@en ;
                              <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "The Substance of Concern (SOC) module of the EU DPP core ontology proposed by the CIRPASS-2 European project."@en ;
                              <http://purl.org/vocab/vann#preferredNamespacePrefix> "soc" ;
                              rdfs:comment "Third iteration of the Substances of Concern module of the EU DPP core ontology proposal of the CIRPASS-2 European project."@en ;
                              rdfs:label "EU DPP SOC"@en ;
                              owl:versionInfo "2.0.0" .

